    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/fa00533c6c423a5299ea3b25f6337b39.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/758ded0a665e36b1a4ad405291e573c6.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span>In The Perfect Model, step into the shoes of a determined college student juggling classes, part-time work, and the constant struggle of financial stress. With mounting bills and rent due, the protagonist is desperate for a breakthrough\u2014until an exciting opportunity arises, a photography competition promising a cash prize that could alleviate his burdens.<br><br>Armed with an instant camera borrowed from his dear friend and a never ending perseverance to thrive, the journey begins as the protagonist embarks on a creative adventure, capturing the essence of their surroundings while searching for the perfect model for his final entry. <br><br><strong>GAME CONTENT:</strong><br>- 10,000 words of story content<br>- 400+ Images<br>- 15+ Animation<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/d69752f9e473a7e8b912351a17347f0d.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/97728a277d25beb8c5eecf963acb2878.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/653026a0f3efa85d815d5327307d9f0a.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/b1182a70d9604ae7d345e312dc79e310.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/f118d50138ea4c1c126b322d226e2586.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329190/extras/02988461084cb747001487d23bb98e95.avif?t=1736954704\" data-has-big width=800 height=283 /></span></p></li></ul>",
